# ML Tech Digest

Archive of the team's shared machine-learning YouTube playlist
(https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLyzTA8cetPdHtlGw1X8Kt7Ea4bd27ApR7).

Contents:

- `video_inventory.md` - every video in the playlist, classified as ML / non-ML
- `ml_tech.md` - the distinct ML technologies that have an official GitHub repository
- `summary.md` - the headline numbers
